  "verseCount": 18,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "1",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "JOS 1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "1",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 1:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chafwiliyi kambuŋa Yehova Mosi, Yehova hakumwila mwana kaNuni Yoshuwa, kambanji kaMosi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.1.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.1.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 1:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nindi, Kambuŋami Mosi nafwi dehi; dichi dinu nyamukaku wuzambu ki Yodana iwu, nineyi niantu awa ejima, muyi mwituŋa dinukuyinka, dinukuyinka wena anyana kaIsarela. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.1.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.1.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 1:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwejima kwakadata nyendu yenu nayinki kwenu, neyi mwomuna hosheli naMosi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.1.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.1.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 1:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kufumisha kwisaŋa odu, nikuLebanoniiyi, nakutwala kukaloŋakeneni, yowu kaloŋa Yufurati, ituŋa dawaHiti dejima, lusu nikukaluŋalwiji keneni kwayaŋa itaŋwa, kwakekala ŋinza yenu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.1.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.1.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 1:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hikwakekala muntuwakakutweshaku mafuku ejima iwakahanda. Neyicho chu nadiŋilaŋa naMosi, dimu nukwikalila naneyi. Hinakakukaŋeshaku, hinakakulekaku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.1.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.1.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 1:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wakadikwatishaŋa, wakomikaŋa chacheni, muloŋa eyi yeyi wakayitambwilaantu awa ituŋa dinayisanyikilili ankakulula jawu nami nakayinkadu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.1.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.1.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 1:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chiŋa wakadikwatishaŋa, wakomikaŋa chacheni, wakashuku muchimawakwila mwaya nshimbi jakulejeliyi kambuŋami Mosi mwejima. Ba yiwakamotokamu nakuya hela kuchikasa chachidiilu hela kuchikasa chachimunswaku, kulonda wakamoni kuwaha kwejima kuwakaya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.1.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.1.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 1:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Weniwumukanda wanshimbi bayi wakafuma mukanwa keyuku, chiŋa wakatoŋojokaŋaamu nimwaana niwufuku, kulonda wakashuku muchima wakwila mwejima mwanasonekuwu, dichi wakakooleka munjilayeyi, dichi wakamonakuwaha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.1.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.1.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 1:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Netu, nakuleji? Kadikwatishaŋa, wakomikaŋa chacheni, bayi wakatiyaŋa womaku, bayi wakaakama akwenuku; muloŋa Yehova Nzambi yeyi wudi naneyi mwejima muwukuya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.1.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.1.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 1:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yoshuwa hakuleja tulala twawantu, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.1.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.1.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 1:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nindi, Hitenu mukachi kachilombu, muyileji antu, nenu, Loŋeshenu yakudya yenu; muloŋa chimukuhita mafuku asatu mukumuzambuka Yodana iwu, kulonda mwiŋili mwitu ijina ku ditambula, dodituŋa dakuyinkayi Yehova Nzambi yenu, nindi mwakaditambuli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.1.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.1.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 1:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ARubeni, nawaGadi, namuchidi waManase wachibalu, Yoshuwa wayilili, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.1.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.1.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 1:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nindi, Anukenu izu dayilejeliyi kambuŋa Yehova Mosi, cheliliyi nindi, Yehova Nzambi yenu hakuyinookesha, wakayinka ituŋidi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.1.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.1.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 1:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Niaŋodi jenu, ni anyanenu anyanya, niyimuna yenu, akashala mwituŋa dayinkeliyi Mosi ishinadi dinu daYodana; hakwinza enu ayilobu akwaŋovu, wejimawenu mwakamanyeka, mwakazambukaŋahu dehi, mwakayikwashuku anakwenu; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.1.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.1.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 1:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nichakayinookeshayi Yehova ana kwenu, neyi chanayinookeshiyienu, nichakatambulawu fituŋa dakuyinkayi Yehova Nzambi yenu; henohu dihu mwamba kafunta kwituŋa dimunatambuli, mwakaditambuli, dayinkeliyi kambuŋa Yehova Mosi ishinadi dinu daYodana, kwokumbadi yaselelaŋa itaŋwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.1.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.1.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 1:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wena hiyakumwila Yoshuwa, nawu, Mwejima muwunatulejidimu twakela, kwejima kuwukututemesha twakaya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.1.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.1.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 1:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwomu twamutiyilili Mosi muyuma yejima, dimu mutwakakutiyilila nineyi; chiŋa Yehova Nzambi yeyi ekali naneyi neyi china chadiŋilaŋayi naMosi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.1.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.1.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 1:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yowu wakadikaŋa nezu deyi, nákubula kutiya mazu eyi mwejima wakamuleja, akamujahi; chiŋa wakadikwatishaŋa, wakomikaŋa chacheni.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.1.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.1.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
